ine/godot/pull/113123.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113123.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"See godotengine/godot-docs#11490 for the original issue.\r\n\r\nThe `SphereMesh` and `SphereShape3D` have different parameters.\r\nWhile `SphereShape3D`'s `radius` parameter affects the radius of the whole sphere, `SphereMesh`'s `radius` parameter only relates to its equator's radius.\r\n\r\nIn this change, I update the documentation of `SphereMesh`'s `radius` to better reflect that it actually only refers to the equator. I also point to the `height` member.\r\n\r\nI do not know how this impacts translations however. Please do tell me if there's some action I need to take to fix them/mark them as outdated.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113123/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113123/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}